     "to": "Maker page: 990 x 698 x 381 mm, 80 kg, 100 kg payload, 2 m/s, IP54, 30 deg climb, four in-wheel brushless motors, ROS 2 Jazzy. Page runtime is 8 h typical, 16 h upgraded and 24 h extended, while the October 2024 datasheet gives 4 h with the 1.02 kWh standard pack, so 4 h is kept. Page height is 381 mm including the rear e-ink display; the datasheet gives 372 mm."
